		<p>Commencing its journey as a humble computer centre housed within a two-room setup at Capri Trade Center, Graphic Era has since expanded into a renowned educational entity encompassing two universities, spanning four campuses across two cities. These institutions work collectively to cultivate the nation's youth into proficient industry professionals.</p><p>It is well known that accessible and high-quality medical institutions of reasonable cost serve as fundamental cornerstones in ensuring an equitable healthcare landscape and cultivating proficient healthcare practitioners. With that in mind, the primary objective of Graphic Era Hospital/Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences is to create a healthcare environment centred around patients of global standards within Uttarakhand.</p><p>The Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences stands out through its provision of ultra-modern facilities, culminating in a future expansion plan to accommodate a substantial 1250-bed capacity. Moreover, the institute prides itself on a cadre of experienced doctors and nurses dedicated to delivering exceptional patient care, assuring the utmost attention and expertise to each individual under their supervision. The expansion, coupled with state-of-the-art infrastructure conforming to international standards, serves as a testament to Graphic Era’s commitment to excellence.</p>		
