			<h2>How to Apply at GEIMS</h2>";s:10:"post_title";s:27:"Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology";s:12:"post_excerpt";s:0:"";s:11:"post_status";s:7:"publish";s:14:"comment_status";s:6:"closed";s:11:"ping_status";s:6:"closed";s:13:"post_password";s:0:"";s:9:"post_name";s:21:"obstetrics-gynecology";s:7:"to_ping";s:0:"";s:6:"pinged";s:0:"";s:13:"post_modified";s:19:"2026-08-14 12:43:44";s:17:"post_modified_gmt";s:19:"2026-08-14 07:13:44";s:21:"post_content_filtered";s:0:"";s:11:"post_parent";s:4:"1706";s:4:"guid";s:37:"https://geims.geu.ac.in/?page_id=5773";s:10:"menu_order";s:1:"0";s:9:"post_type";s:4:"page";s:14:"post_mime_type";s:0:"";s:13:"comment_count";s:1:"0";}i:4;O:8:"stdClass":23:{s:2:"ID";s:4:"5775";s:11:"post_author";s:1:"1";s:9:"post_date";s:19:"2023-12-08 06:21:45";s:13:"post_date_gmt";s:19:"2023-12-08 06:21:45";s:12:"post_content";s:36046:"<p>In the Anaesthesiology Department, students learn pain management, critical care, and administering anaesthesia for surgeries. It focuses on patient safety and comfort during medical interventions.</p><p><strong>GEIMS Anaesthesiology Department: Ensuring Comfort and Safety in Medical Procedures</strong></p>		
		<p>In the Anaesthesiology Department, students delve into pain management, critical care, and anaesthesia administration for surgeries, emphasising patient safety and comfort. This field nurtures clinical expertise, offering hands-on experiences vital for future anesthesiologists. Opportunities abound in diverse medical settings, from surgery suites to intensive care units, paving pathways for specialised practice and research. The department equips aspiring professionals with indispensable skills, fostering adeptness in advanced medical interventions and positioning them to lead in innovative pain management techniques. Its focus on experiential learning prepares students for impactful roles, driving advancements in anesthesiology and ensuring optimal patient care in evolving healthcare landscapes.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Key Highlights</strong></p><p>The Anaesthesiology Department at GEIMS is known for its robust education, hands-on training, and diverse career avenues. Engage in pioneering research driving advancements in anaesthesia and patient care within the evolving healthcare landscape.</p><ul><li><strong>Comprehensive Anesthesia Education:</strong> Rigorous training encompassing pain management, critical care, and anaesthesia administration for diverse surgical procedures.</li><li><strong>Clinical Immersion:</strong> Hands-on experience integral for cultivating adept anesthesiologists.</li><li><strong>Diverse Career Trajectories:</strong> Opportunities spanning various medical settings, from surgery suites to intensive care units.</li><li><strong>Cutting-edge Research Endeavors:</strong> Exploration and innovation in advanced pain management methodologies.</li></ul>		
			<h5>Department Info</h5>		
		<p>Department of Anaesthesiology</p><p>Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences<br />16th Milestone, Chakrata Rd, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248008</p>		
