		<h4> </h4><h4><strong>Profile of Prof. (Dr.) Narpinder Singh</strong></h4><h4>Qualifications</h4><p>BSc, 1982; MSc (Food Technology), 1984; Ph.D., 1989 (Food Technology) from Punjab Agricultural University (PAU), Ludhiana, India. Awarded research fellowship in Engineering and Technology by UGC during Ph.D.</p><h4><strong>Awards</strong></h4><p> </p><ul><li>Professor Krishna Sahai Bilgrami Memorial Medal in Agricultural Sciences by Indian National Science Academy-2021</li><li>J.C. Bose National Fellowship awarded by Department of Science and Technology, Govt. of India, 2011</li><li>Rafi Ahmed Kidwai Award for outstanding contribution in Natural Resource Management &amp; Agricultural Engineering awarded by Indian Council of Agricultural Research, 2010</li><li>Highly Cited researcher in recognition of exceptional research performance demonstrated by production of multiple highly cited papers that rank in top 1%for the field and year in Agricultural Sciences by Clarivate-2022</li><li>Highly Cited researcher in recognition of exceptional research performance demonstrated by production of multiple highly cited papers that rank in top 1%for the field and year in Agricultural Sciences by Clarivate-2021</li><li>Indian Research Excellence–Citations Award in Agriculture Science awarded by Web of Science, 2019</li><li>Excellence in Carbohydrate Research Award awarded by Association of Carbohydrate Chemists &amp; Technologists, 2016</li><li>Ramana Fellowship awarded by Department of Science &amp; Technology, Govt. of India, 2007-2010</li><li>Recognition Award awarded by National Academy of Agricultural Sciences, 2007-2008</li><li>Laljee Godhoo Smarak Nidhi Award by Association of Food Scientists &amp; Technologists, India, 2005</li><li>C.N.R. Rao Educational Foundation Award by GNDU for Excellence in Research, 2007</li><li>Award of Honour by Alumni Association, College of Agriculture, PAU, Ludhiana, 2011</li><li>Certificate of Appreciation by Punjab Agricultural University, Ludhiana, 2012</li><li>S. Bishan Singh Samundri Memorial Lectureship Award awarded by Guru Nanak Dev University, Amritsar, 2012</li><li>Pran Vohra Award awarded by Indian Science Congress Association, 1997-1998</li><li>Appreciation Certificate awarded by Punjab State Council for Science and Technology, 1990-1993</li><li>Young Scientist Medal in Agricultural sciences awarded by Indian National Science Academy, 1993</li><li>Best Research Papers Awards awarded by Association of Food Scientists and Technologist India, 2007 &amp; 2016</li></ul><h4>Position Held</h4><p> </p><ul><li>Professor, Department of Food Science and Technology, Guru Nanak Dev University, (GNDU), Amritsar from 14-08-2000 to 31-12- 2022 (22 years), and</li><li>Reader: 07-04-1993 to 13-08-2000 (7 years 4 months), Department of Food Science and Technology, GNDU, Amritsar.</li><li>Assistant Professor: 29-03-1988 to 06-04-1993 (4 years 11 months), Department of Food Science and Technology, PAU, Ludhiana</li><li>Research Fellow (ICAR Project): 25-02-1985 to 14-11-1985, Department of Food Science and Technology, PAU, Ludhiana</li><li>Director of Research:10-05-2017 to 03-06-2020 (3 Years 0 Months), GNDU, Amritsar</li><li>Dean: (Faculty of Applied Sciences): 10-07-2010 to 30-06-2012; 04-08-2008 to 13-12-2009 (3 Years 3 Months), GNDU, Amritsar</li><li>Head: Department of Food Science &amp; Technology, GNDU, Amritsar: 01-07-2018 to 30-06-2021; 30-08-2001 to 28-06-2004; 06-06-1997 to 05-06-2000 (8 Years 11 months).</li><li>Coordinator: (Uni.-Industry Linkage Programme), GNDU: 12-11-2008 to 31-03-2012 (3 Years 4 Months)</li><li>Coordinator: (UGC-SAP), GNDU: 01-04-2012 to 31-03-2017 (5 Years).</li><li>Coordinator: (Centre for Advance Research in Food Sciences): 12-04-2006 to 22-03-2007 (11 Months).</li></ul><h4> </h4><h4><b>Fellow</b><b> </b><b>of</b><b> </b><b>National</b><b> </b><b>and</b><b> </b><b>International</b><b> </b><b>academies/associations:</b></h4><p> </p><ul><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">The Royal Society of Chemistry (FRSC), 2022</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">Punjab Academy of Science (PAS), 2022.</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">Cereals &amp; Grain Association (Formerly Association of Cereal Chemists International), 2019</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">National Academy of Agricultural Sciences (NAAS), 2005</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">Indian National Science Academy (INSA), 2010</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">National Academy of Sciences, India (NASI), 2011</li><li data-ogsc="rgb(0, 0, 0)">Association of Food Scientists and Technologist India (AFSTI), 2012</li></ul>";s:10:"post_title";s:15:"Vice-Chancellor";s:12:"post_excerpt";s:0:"";s:11:"post_status";s:7:"publish";s:14:"comment_status";s:6:"closed";s:11:"ping_status";s:6:"closed";s:13:"post_password";s:0:"";s:9:"post_name";s:15:"vice-chancellor";s:7:"to_ping";s:0:"";s:6:"pinged";s:0:"";s:13:"post_modified";s:19:"2025-06-09 17:04:02";s:17:"post_modified_gmt";s:19:"2025-06-09 11:34:02";s:21:"post_content_filtered";s:0:"";s:11:"post_parent";s:4:"1149";s:4:"guid";s:37:"https://geims.geu.ac.in/?page_id=6696";s:10:"menu_order";s:1:"0";s:9:"post_type";s:4:"page";s:14:"post_mime_type";s:0:"";s:13:"comment_count";s:1:"0";}i:27;O:8:"stdClass":23:{s:2:"ID";s:5:"11357";s:11:"post_author";s:1:"5";s:9:"post_date";s:19:"2026-07-06 12:21:08";s:13:"post_date_gmt";s:19:"2026-07-06 06:51:08";s:12:"post_content";s:10420:"<p>Welcome to the Department of Emergency Medicine at Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences (GEIMS). It is the high-stakes, fast-paced heart of a hospital.</p><p><strong>GEIMS Dermatology Department: Expert Care When Every Second Counts.</strong></p>		
		<p><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Comprehensive Trauma Infrastructure:</b> Specialized workflows for severe physical trauma, emphasizing multidisciplinary care for <b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="126">Road Traffic Accidents</b> (fractures, head, and spinal injuries) and <b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="192">Industrial Accidents</b> (crush injuries, severe burns, and chemical exposures).</p><p><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Life-Threatening Pathologies:</b> Bedside care protocols explicitly listed for acute conditions such as sudden cardiac arrest, severe internal/external hemorrhaging, acute seizures, and drowning.</p><p><b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Demographic-Specific Emergency Care:</b> Dedicated sections detailing tailored interventions for <b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="93">Pediatric</b> and <b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="107">Geriatric</b> emergencies, recognizing that children and elderly patients have distinct physiological needs during an acute crisis.</p><p><b data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">24/7 On-Site Imaging:</b> Real-time access to X-rays, high-speed CT scans, MRIs, and bedside ultrasounds for rapid evaluation of internal injuries.</p><p><b data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Accelerated Lab Services:</b> Dedicated turnaround protocols for toxicology screens, coagulation profiles, and rapid blood testing.</p><p><b data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Top Emergency Procedures:</b> Visibility into immediate surgical capabilities, showcasing readiness for fracture fixations, emergency laparotomies, emergency neurosurgery, and advanced skin grafting.</p>		
			<h5>Department Info</h5>		
		<p>Department of Emergency Medicine</p><p>Graphic Era Institute of Medical Sciences<br />16th Milestone, Chakrata Rd, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248008</p>		
